  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">East African Community Capital Markets            Development/EAC/IFC/World Bank - East Af Community Capital Markets World Bank IFO</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">East African Community Capital Markets            Development/EAC/IFC/World Bank</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den f&#xf6;reslagna &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder kommer att g&#xf6;ra det m&#xf6;jligt f&#xf6;r projektet att f&#xe5; n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndig teknisk hj&#xe4;lp genom en V&#xe4;rldsbanken Externally Funded    Output (EFO) mekanism. Det kommer ocks&#xe5; att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra en Efficient   Securities Markets Institutional Development(ESMID) f&#xf6;r att ge sin    teknisk input i utvecklingen av en regional obligationsmarknad f&#xf6;r    EAC regionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed intervention will enable the project to obtain the       requisite technical assistance through a World Bank Externally Funded Output (EFO) mechanism. It will also enable the Efficient Securities  Markets Institutional Development (ESMID) to provide their technical  input in the development of a regional bond market for the EAC        region.</narrative>
  </description>
